  "faithful": "And this is the sum of a series of proportions which follow, in which the author displays the most accurate equation and precise conception of the subject, and great address and elegance in his mathematical analysis. He at length brings out an equation which expresses the pressure on the body in the most general and unexceptionable manner. We cannot give an abstract, because the train of reasoning is already concise in the extreme: nor can we even exhibit the final equation, for it is conceived in the direction.",
